        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Falcon D271, Restroom Door Occupancy Indicator Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Falcon restroom occupancy indicator door bolt is for use on commercial and office bathroom doors. The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by an inside thumb turn unit. The occupancy indicator on the outside is color coded and reads either <b>\"In Use\"</b> or <b>\"Vacant\"</b>. Easy to install, this Falcon deadbolt is adjustable to fit either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Falcon D271 Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 1-3/8 to 2-1/4\" thick doors.</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets. </li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations. </li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5, 2001 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim.</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Includes Emergency Release Key for opening locked doors when necessary.  </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Privacy door bolt uses a Thumbturn inside and has Occupancy Indicator outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
