                "description": "Falcon D271 Restroom Door Occupancy Indicator Lock - The Falcon restroom occupancy indicator door bolt is for use on commercial and office bathroom doors. The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by an inside thumb turn unit. The occupancy indicator on the outside reads either In Use or Vacant with color coding. Easy to install, this Falcon deadbolt is adjustable to fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
